  "solution": "Now check all the options:\n\nGiven: 8 + 1 − 36 ÷ 2 × 3\n\n**Option 1 :** − and ×\n\nAfter interchange the − and ×,\n\n= 8 + 1 × *__**36 ÷ 2**__* - 3\n\n= 8 + *__**1 × 18**__* - 3\n\n= *__**8 + 18**__* – 3\n\n= *__**26 – 3**__*\n\n= 23 **≠ 61**\n\n**Option 2 : **− and +\n\n**After interchange the - and +,**\n\n**= ****8 - 1 + *__36 ÷ 2__* × 3**\n\n**= ****8 – 1 + *__18 × 3__***\n\n**= *__8__* – 1 *__+ 54__***\n\n**= *__62 – 1__***\n\n**= 61**\n\n**Option 3 :** + and ÷\n\nAfter interchange the + and ÷,\n\n= ***__8 ÷ 1__*** − 36 + 2 × 3\n\n= 8 − 36 + *__**2 × 3**__*\n\n= *__**8 **__*– 36 *__**+ 6**__*\n\n= *__**14 – 36**__*\n\n= 22 **≠ 61**\n\n**Option 4 :** ÷ and ×\n\nAfter interchange the + and ÷,\n\n= 8 + 1 − 36 × *__**2 ÷ 3**__*\n\n= 8 + 1 – *__**36 × 0.67**__*\n\n= *__**8 + 1**__* - 24\n\n= *__**9 - 24**__*\n\n= - 15 **≠ 61**\n\nHence, the correct `answer is **Option 2 : “****− and +****”.**",
